findings.suggested_fix:
对 settings.json 不存在的情况跳过备份。将 line 95-97 改为：

```swift
let backupPath = settingsPath + ".muxy-backup"
if FileManager.default.fileExists(atPath: settingsPath) {
    try? FileManager.default.removeItem(atPath: backupPath)
    try FileManager.default.copyItem(atPath: settingsPath, toPath: backupPath)
}
```

或更简单地，将 backup 的 copyItem 包装为 try?：

```swift
try? FileManager.default.removeItem(atPath: backupPath)
try? FileManager.default.copyItem(atPath: settingsPath, toPath: backupPath)
```

但要注意第二种方案会吞掉其他文件系统错误。推荐第一种方案——只在文件存在时备份。
